    BUHBYE

    BTW Function with nested arithmetic
    HOW IZ I complexCalc YR x AN YR y AN YR z
        FOUND YR SUM OF PRODUKT OF x AN y AN QUOSHUNT OF z AN SUM OF x AN y
    IF U SAY SO

    BTW Function that calls another function (if supported)
    HOW IZ I add YR x AN YR y
        FOUND YR SUM OF x AN y
    IF U SAY SO

    HOW IZ I multiply YR x AN YR y
        FOUND YR PRODUKT OF x AN y
    IF U SAY SO

    HOW IZ I combined YR x AN YR y AN YR z
        FOUND YR SUM OF I IZ add YR x AN YR y AN I IZ multiply YR y AN YR z
    IF U SAY SO

    a R 5
    b R 3
    c R 2

    BTW Call function with nested expressions
    I IZ complexCalc YR SUM OF a AN 1 AN YR DIFF OF b AN 1 AN YR PRODUKT OF c AN 2
    VISIBLE IT

    BTW Nested function calls in arithmetic
    VISIBLE SUM OF I IZ add YR a AN YR b AN I IZ multiply YR b AN YR c

    BTW Function in conditional
    BIGGR OF I IZ add YR a AN YR b AN 5
    O RLY?
        YA RLY
            VISIBLE "Function result > 5"
        NO WAI
            VISIBLE "Function result <= 5"
    OIC

    BTW Function in loop
    IM IN YR func_loop UPPIN YR i WILE BOTH SAEM i AN SMALLR OF i AN 3
        I IZ add YR i AN YR 1
        VISIBLE IT
    IM OUTTA YR func_loop

KTHXBYE

